📋 Prerequisites (Yang Harus Disiapkan)
Komponen	Spesifikasi
Server	Linux (Ubuntu/Debian/Raspberry Pi/STB/ARM64)
RAM	Minimal 2GB (lebih besar lebih cepat)
Storage	Minimal 10GB free
Docker & Docker Compose	Harus terinstall
Domain (opsional)	Untuk akses via internet (Cloudflare Tunnel)
🚀 Langkah 1: Install Docker & Docker Compose
bash

# Install Docker
curl -fsSL https://get.docker.com | bash

# Install Docker Compose
apt install docker-compose -y

# Cek versi
docker --version
docker-compose --version

📁 Langkah 2: Buat Struktur Folder Project
bash

# Buat folder utama
mkdir -p /DATA/AppData/school-master
cd /DATA/AppData/school-master

# Buat folder untuk konfigurasi Nginx
mkdir -p docker/nginx

📄 Langkah 3: Upload File Project

Upload semua file project school-master ke /DATA/AppData/school-master/

Cara upload:

    Via SCP: scp -r school-master/* root@ip_server:/DATA/AppData/school-master/

    Via File Manager (CasaOS, aaPanel, etc.)

    Via Git clone

🐳 Langkah 4: Buat File Konfigurasi Nginx
bash

nano /DATA/AppData/school-master/docker/nginx/default.conf

Isi dengan:
nginx

server {
    listen 80;
    server_name localhost;
    root /var/www/html/public;
    index index.php index.html;

    location / {
        try_files $uri $uri/ /index.php?$query_string;
    }

    location ~ \.php$ {
        fastcgi_pass php:9000;
        fastcgi_index index.php;
        fastcgi_param SCRIPT_FILENAME $document_root$fastcgi_script_name;
        include fastcgi_params;
    }
}

🐳 Langkah 5: Buat docker-compose.yml
bash

nano /DATA/AppData/school-master/docker-compose.yml

Isi dengan:
yaml

version: '3.8'

services:
  app:
    image: nginx:alpine
    container_name: school-master-app
    ports:
      - "8082:80"
    volumes:
      - .:/var/www/html
      - ./docker/nginx/default.conf:/etc/nginx/conf.d/default.conf
    depends_on:
      - php
      - mariadb
    restart: unless-stopped

  php:
    image: php:7.4-fpm-alpine
    container_name: school-master-php
    volumes:
      - .:/var/www/html
    restart: unless-stopped

  mariadb:
    image: mariadb:10.11
    container_name: school-master-db
    ports:
      - "3307:3306"
    environment:
      MYSQL_ROOT_PASSWORD: root123
      MYSQL_DATABASE: school_db
      MYSQL_USER: school_user
      MYSQL_PASSWORD: password123
    volumes:
      - ./mysql_data:/var/lib/mysql
    restart: unless-stopped

🚀 Langkah 6: Jalankan Container
bash

cd /DATA/AppData/school-master
docker-compose up -d

Cek status:
bash

docker ps

Seharusnya ada 3 container running.
⚙️ Langkah 7: Setup PHP Container (Install Composer & Dependencies)
bash

# Masuk ke container PHP
docker exec -it school-master-php sh

# Install Composer
curl -sS https://getcomposer.org/installer | php
mv composer.phar /usr/local/bin/composer
chmod +x /usr/local/bin/composer

# Bypass security advisory (untuk project lawas)
composer config --global policy.advisories.block false

# Install PDO MySQL (WAJIB untuk Laravel)
docker-php-ext-install pdo_mysql

# Install dependencies (bypass platform requirements)
cd /var/www/html
composer update --ignore-platform-req=ext-zip --ignore-platform-req=php

# Generate application key
php artisan key:generate

# Migrate database
php artisan migrate

# Seed data (opsional)
php artisan db:seed

# Set permission
chmod -R 775 storage bootstrap/cache

# Keluar
exit

