🌐 Langkah 9 (Opsional): Akses via Domain (Cloudflare Tunnel)
9.1 Install cloudflared
bash

# Download cloudflared untuk ARM64
wget https://github.com/cloudflare/cloudflared/releases/latest/download/cloudflared-linux-arm64
chmod +x cloudflared-linux-arm64
mv cloudflared-linux-arm64 /usr/local/bin/cloudflared

9.2 Login ke Cloudflare
bash

cloudflared tunnel login

(Buka link, pilih domain, authorize)
9.3 Buat tunnel baru
bash

cloudflared tunnel create school-master

9.4 Buat file konfigurasi
bash

nano ~/.cloudflared/config.yml

Isi:
yaml

tunnel: ID_TUNNEL_ANDA
credentials-file: /root/.cloudflared/ID_TUNNEL_ANDA.json

ingress:
  - hostname: school.domain-anda.com
    service: http://localhost:8082
  - service: http_status:404

9.5 Route DNS
bash

cloudflared tunnel route dns ID_TUNNEL_ANDA school.domain-anda.com

9.6 Jalankan tunnel
bash

cloudflared tunnel run ID_TUNNEL_ANDA

9.7 Install sebagai service (auto start)
bash

cloudflared service install
systemctl start cloudflared
systemctl enable cloudflared

🗑️ Langkah 10 (Opsional): Uninstall / Cleanup
bash

# Hentikan container
cd /DATA/AppData/school-master
docker-compose down

# Hapus semua data
rm -rf /DATA/AppData/school-master

# Hapus Docker images (jika tidak dipakai)
docker system prune -a

# Hapus cloudflared (jika tidak dipakai)
cloudflared service uninstall
rm -f /usr/local/bin/cloudflared
rm -rf ~/.cloudflared

📊 Ringkasan Perintah Cepat (Cheat Sheet)
Tahap	Perintah
Install Docker	curl -fsSL https://get.docker.com | bash
Buat folder	mkdir -p /DATA/AppData/school-master/docker/nginx
Upload project	scp -r ./school-master root@server:/DATA/AppData/school-master/
Buat config Nginx	(lihat di atas)
Buat compose	(lihat di atas)
Start container	docker-compose up -d
Setup PHP	docker exec -it school-master-php sh lalu curl -sS https://getcomposer.org/installer | php && mv composer.phar /usr/local/bin/composer && chmod +x /usr/local/bin/composer
Install PDO	docker-php-ext-install pdo_mysql
Install Laravel	composer update --ignore-platform-reqs && php artisan key:generate && php artisan migrate
Akses	http://IP:8082
⚠️ Catatan Penting untuk Build ke Server Lain
Komponen	Server ARM (STB/RPi)	Server x86_64 (VPS)
cloudflared binary	cloudflared-linux-arm64	cloudflared-linux-amd64
PHP Image	php:7.4-fpm-alpine (dari Docker Hub)	Sama
Docker Compose	Sama	Sama
Waktu compile pdo_mysql	Lama (15-30 menit)	Cepat (1-2 menit)

