Tips untuk Deployment ke Server Lain

Jangan lupa selalu jalankan perintah ini setelah deploy Laravel di Docker:
bash

docker exec -it [container-php] sh -c "chmod -R 775 /var/www/html/storage"
docker exec -it [container-php] sh -c "chmod -R 775 /var/www/html/bootstrap/cache"
docker exec -it [container-php] sh -c "mkdir -p /var/www/html/storage/framework/sessions"